    "body": "## Problem\r\n`-S [file]` doesn't make sense in the context of `:restart` and likely isn't wanted for `:restart!`. Explained in this [comment](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/38940#issuecomment-4842640569)\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\n- Remove `-S [file]` from `v:argv` when doing :restart.\r\n- Also for the \"bang\" variant `:restart!`, just because it's simpler (if anyone reports a use-case later, we can revisit).\r\n\r\nNote:\r\nThere is a related [wish](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/39239#issuecomment-4279290961) to drop all `[files]` (`v:argf`), but that may be in-progress in #39586",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-05T21:53:46Z",
